Probably a FAQ.  The only ways to get aggravate monster are to eat:
  - a cat (kitten, housecat, large cat)
  - a dog (little dog, dog, large dog)
  - by being a cannibal.  If you're a human that means eating a 
    human, if you're an elf that means eating an elf (which is 
    why elves can eat the wizard safely).

Reading spellbooks and getting that "you feel threatend" message
aggravates the monsters currently on the level, but does not give
you the intrinsic.

It's not really the worst intrinsic around.  If you have stealth
then it does nothing (except against sleeping ettins for some 
strange reason).  
